-- **Time Complexity:** $O(N \cdot r)$, where $N$ is the number of voxels and $r$ is the radius (number of iterations). Each iteration is $O(N)$ due to the separable nature.
-- **Memory Complexity:** $O(N)$ for storing the voxel grid.
